<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88899" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσδια-φθείρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>destroy besides</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				76
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				26.1
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>perish besides</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				19.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>corrupt, spoil besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς λοιποὺς ταπιδοφάντας</span>”
				<i>PCair Zen.</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					484.16
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τροφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.53
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χρηστὸν αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				51.36.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑπάρχον</span>
			<i>cause abortion of</i> the existing foetus <i>as well</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				1.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>pervert besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ἐλπίσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cic.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Luc.</u>
				30
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				4.3.2
			</span></i>.</div>
